{"title":"살인마의 인터뷰","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=1ZmJz/hAJjGaz1iG/EWoK1Y0KTnFOcdpvf9QL20&filename=th3","synopsis":"부모를 잃고 할머니와 둘이 살던 하준.\n\n부모의 죽음에 대한 진실을 알고 경찰이 되었지만 파출소 순경의 삶은 꿈꿨던 형사의 삶과는 달리 고단하기만 하다.\n\n‘전설적인 형사들이 앞에 나타나 사건에 대한 단서라도 던져줬으면 좋겠다.’\n\n답답한 마음에 어릴 적 부모님과 살던 비닐하우스 집을 찾아가는데…\n\n그 곳에서 발견한 아버지의 책 하나.\n\n책을 펴자 하준의 눈 앞에 나타난 것은 전설의 살인마들?\n\n아니 거기서 당신들이 왜 나와?!!!","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":97,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":103,"change":{"type":"down","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":101,"change":{"type":"up","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":61,"change":{"type":"up","amount":40}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":79,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":111,"change":{"type":"down","amount":32}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":111,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":81,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":122,"change":{"type":"down","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":59,"change":{"type":"up","amount":63}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":98,"change":{"type":"down","amount":39}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":98,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":129,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":124,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":102,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":139,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":81,"change":{"type":"up","amount":58}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":102,"change":{"type":"down","amount":21}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":106,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":126,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":134,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":136,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":138,"change